{
  "name": "Infectious Fury",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with your natural weapons while you are raging, the beast within you can curse your target with rabid fury. The target must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw (DC equal to 8 + your Constitution modifier + your Proficiency bonus) or suffer one of the following effects (your choice):</p><ul><li>The target must use its Reaction to make a melee attack against another creature of your choice that you can see.</li><li>The target takes 2d12 psychic damage.</li></ul><p>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
